.\" ###### Setup ############################################################
.Dd October 17, 2026
.Dt get\-system\-info 1
.Os get\-system\-info
.\" ###### Name #############################################################
.Sh NAME
.Nm get\-system\-info
.Nd obtains system information
.\" ###### Synopsis #########################################################
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm get\-system\-info
.Op Fl c Ar version | Fl \-compatibility Ar version
.br
.Op Fl A | Fl \-all
.Op Fl a | Fl \-none
.br
.Op Fl B | Fl \-with\-battery
.Op Fl b | Fl \-without\-battery
.br
.Op Fl E | Fl \-with\-os
.Op Fl e | Fl \-without\-os
.br
.Op Fl F | Fl \-with\-ssh
.Op Fl f | Fl \-without\-ssh
.br
.Op Fl K | Fl \-with\-kernel
.Op Fl k | Fl \-without\-kernel
.br
.Op Fl L | Fl \-with\-load
.Op Fl l | Fl \-without\-load
.br
.Op Fl M | Fl \-with\-memory
.Op Fl m | Fl \-without\-memory
.br
.Op Fl N | Fl \-with\-network
.Op Fl n | Fl \-without\-network
.br
.Op Fl O | Fl \-with\-hostname
.Op Fl o | Fl \-without\-hostname
.br
.Op Fl S | Fl \-with\-storage
.Op Fl s | Fl \-without\-storage
.br
.Op Fl T | Fl \-with\-uptime
.Op Fl t | Fl \-without\-uptime
.br
.Op Fl U | Fl \-with\-user
.Op Fl u | Fl \-without\-user
.Nm get\-system\-info
.Op Fl h | Fl \-help
.Nm get\-system\-info
.Op Fl v | Fl \-version
.\" ###### Description ######################################################
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm get\-system\-info
obtains system information in machine\-readable form.
It is mainly intended for being used by
.Xr System\-Info 1.
.\" ###### Arguments ########################################################
.Sh ARGUMENTS
The following options are available:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl c Ar version | Fl \-compatibility Ar version
Request a certain version for the output.
This option is to allow for future changes of
.Nm get\-system\-info .
Currently, the only available version is 0.
.It Fl A | Fl \-all
Query all system information (default).
.It Fl a | Fl \-none
Do not query any system information.
.It Fl B | Fl \-with\-battery
Enable query of battery information.
.It Fl b | Fl \-without\-battery
Disable query of battery information.
.It Fl E | Fl \-with\-os
Enable query of operating system release information.
.It Fl e | Fl \-without\-os
Disable query of operating system release information.
.It Fl F | Fl \-with\-ssh
Enable query of SSH host key fingerprint information.
.It Fl f | Fl \-without\-ssh
Disable query of SSH host key fingerprint information.
.It Fl K | Fl \-with\-kernel
Enable query of kernel information.
.It Fl k | Fl \-without\-kernel
Disable query of kernel information.
.It Fl L | Fl \-with\-load
Enable query of system load and process information.
.It Fl l | Fl \-without\-load
Disable query of system load and process information.
.It Fl M | Fl \-with\-memory
Enable query of system memory and swap information.
.It Fl m | Fl \-without\-memory
Disable query of system memory and swap information.
.It Fl N | Fl \-with\-network
Enable query of network interface information.
.It Fl n | Fl \-without\-network
Disable query of network interface information.
.It Fl O | Fl \-with\-hostname
Enable query of hostname information.
.It Fl o | Fl \-without\-hostname
Disable query of hostname information.
.It Fl S | Fl \-with\-storage
Enable query of storage and disk usage information.
.It Fl s | Fl \-without\-storage
Disable query of storage and disk usage information.
.It Fl T | Fl \-with\-uptime
Enable query of system uptime information.
.It Fl t | Fl \-without\-uptime
Disable query of system uptime information.
.It Fl U | Fl \-with\-user
Enable query of user information.
.It Fl u | Fl \-without\-user
Disable query of user information.
.It Fl h | Fl \-help
Prints the program's command\-line parameters and exits.
.It Fl v | Fl \-version
Prints the program version and exits.
.El
.\" ###### Exit status ######################################################
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The
.Nm
tool exits with 0 on success, and >0 in case of an error.
.\" ###### Examples #########################################################
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -bullet
.It
get\-system\-info
.It
get\-system\-info \-a \-O \-T \-U
.It
get\-system\-info \-\-none \-\-with\-memory \-\-with\-load
.It
get\-system\-info \-\-without\-battery
.It
LANGUAGE=de_AT get\-system\-info
.It
LANGUAGE=nb get\-system\-info
.It
get\-system\-info \-\-version
.It
get\-system\-info \-v
.It
get\-system\-info \-\-help
.It
get\-system\-info \-h
.El
